  "title": "STERIS Appoints Pierre Boulud to Board of Directors",
  "summary": "DUBLIN, IRELAND, May 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- STERIS plc (NYSE: STE) (“STERIS” or the “Company”) announced today that, effective May 5, 2026, Pierre Boulud has been appointed to the Board of Directors. “We are pleased to welcome Pierre to our Board,” said Mohsen Sohi, Chairman of STERIS.",
